<title>USA: GOLF-THIRD ROUND LEADERS AT TEXAS OPEN.</title>
<headline>GOLF-THIRD ROUND LEADERS AT TEXAS OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO, Texas 1996-10-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leaders after the</p>
<p>third round of the $1.2 million Texas Open golf tournament on</p>
<p>Saturday (U.S. unless noted):</p>
<p>203 David Ogrin 70 65 68</p>
<p>206 Jay Haas 70 66 70</p>
<p>207 Tommy Armour 71 72 64</p>
<p>208 John Morse 68 71 69</p>
<p>209 Kelly Gibson 68 74 67, Hugh Royer 67 74 68, Keith Fergus</p>
<p>70 71 68, Len Mattiace 73 71 65</p>
<p>210 Don Pooley 74 68 68, Corey Pavin 70 70 70, Brad Fabel 71</p>
<p>70 69, Lee Janzen 73 67 70, Mark Calcavecchia 68 70 72, Brian</p>
<p>Claar 69 70 71, Tiger Woods 69 68 73, David Frost (South</p>
<p>Africa) 67 71 72</p>
<p>211 Donnie Hammond 69 74 68, Mike Heinen 66 75 70, Mark</p>
<p>Carnevale 73 71 67, Jeff Maggert 74 67 70, Scott Dunlap 70 70</p>
<p>71, J.L. Lewis 69 71 71, Tim Herron 70 70 71, Olin Browne 71</p>
<p>74 66, John Huston 66 71 74</p>
